column3:
I heard that {actor_name:6}{possessive_suffix}
brother {actor_name:5} lives...{page_break}But why is he with the
men who raided Sol
Sanctum?{end_wait}

If only I'd gone to Sol
Sanctum with {protagonist_name}
and the others...{page_break}It should be me going
on this quest. Not
them.{end_wait}
